                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Kero Blaster is an adorable little game from the creator of Cave Story. The combat here grows in such a natural way that was such a blast to blast through every level, I loved all the gun upgrades and felt like a real force to be reckoned with by the final area!\n\nA neat part of this game too is that when you get a game over you keep any upgrades and coins you've earned so far, meaning that if a level is too difficult you'll be able to buy a better upgrade sooner making the level easier. This is a great approach to difficulty that I appreciate in games; being able to ease the difficulty by failing enough times.\n\nWhile the story here is minimal it gets the job done. I'd like to say this is like if Cave Story was condensed into a much shorter game with expanded combat while maintaining all the cool level designs and boss fights, you'd get Kero Blaster.",
